  "title": "India's Fintech and Rural Infrastructure Initiatives",
  "summary": "India will host the Global Fintech Fest 2026 in Mumbai, showcasing India's technological progress and allocate ₹1,000 crore under the Pradhan Mantri Gram Sadak Yojana for rural road construction. The event will also converge with India's Fintech initiatives and rural infrastructure development programs. India will commemorate its 80th Independence Day on August 15 with PM Modi leading the ceremony at the Red Fort complex, featuring the rendition of 'Vande Mataram' and highlighting Modi's government programs.",
